            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>Player</code> sınıfının bir örneğini oluştur ve <code>health</code> özelliğini görüntüle.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Character\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"104\" endIndex=\"109\" /><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"120\" /><option startIndex=\"121\" endIndex=\"133\" /><option startIndex=\"146\" endIndex=\"157\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Character\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(health) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".health = health;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Character\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hero = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(hero.health);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>const</code>, ardından <code>hero</code> ve sonra <code>= new</code>, <code>Player(100);</code>, <code>hero.health</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
