            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Farklı davranışlarını görmek için <code>hero1</code> ve <code>mage1</code> üzerinde <code>takeDamage()</code> metodunu çağır.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Mage\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"249\" endIndex=\"254\" /><option startIndex=\"254\" endIndex=\"270\" /><option startIndex=\"297\" endIndex=\"302\" /><option startIndex=\"302\" endIndex=\"318\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Hero\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(amount + \" /><text value=\"&quot; damage taken&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Mage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Hero\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (amount === \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;magic shield reduces &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + amount + \" /><text value=\"&quot; damage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hero1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Hero();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hero1.takeDamage(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" mage1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Mage();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"mage1.takeDamage(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>hero1</code>, ardından <code>.takeDamage(10);</code> ve sonra <code>mage1</code>, <code>.takeDamage(10);</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
