            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bu kodda yanlış olan ne?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Weapon\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack(damage) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(damage + \" /><text value=\"&quot; damage dealt&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Sword\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Weapon\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" attack(damage) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  Super.attack(damage);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>super</code> büyük harfle yazılmış; <code>super.attack(damage);</code> olmalı.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kodda yanlış olan hiçbir şey yok</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Alt sınıflar <code>super()</code> çağırmamalıdır</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>super</code> büyük harfle yazılmış; <code>super.attack(damage);</code> olmalı..</p></body></html>"
